main.cpp
--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ operator== of point, not a conversion to count: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ built-in enum comparison: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ count's own operator== and the explicit constructor: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
